req	Plague City
step	1	1	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Elena</col> needs her <col=800000>Distillator</col> back; the Mourners took it when they arrested her. She suggested I speak to <col=800000>Jerico</col>, who lives near the <col=800000>West Ardougne</col> wall.</col>
step	2	2	After speaking to Jerico
line	<str>Elena needs her Distillator back; the Mourners took it when they arrested her.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Jerico</col> keeps carrier pigeons in a cage behind his house, and there is bird feed in his cupboard. I should speak to <col=800000>Omart</col> about getting over the wall.</col>
step	3	3	After speaking to Omart
line	<str>Elena needs her Distillator back; the Mourners took it when they arrested her.</str>
line	<str>Jerico keeps carrier pigeons in a cage behind his house, and there is bird feed in his cupboard.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Omart</col> will help me over the wall, but he needs a distraction for the Mourners in the watchtower. The pigeons might do the trick.</col>
step	4	4	After distracting the watchtower
line	<str>Elena needs her Distillator back; the Mourners took it when they arrested her.</str>
line	<str>Jerico keeps carrier pigeons in a cage behind his house, and there is bird feed in his cupboard.</str>
line	<str>Omart will help me over the wall, but he needs a distraction for the Mourners in the watchtower.</str>
line	<col=000080>I threw bird feed by the watchtower fence and released the pigeons, which distracted the Mourners. I should go back to <col=800000>Omart</col>.</col>
step	5	5	After climbing the wall
line	<str>Elena needs her Distillator back; the Mourners took it when they arrested her.</str>
line	<str>Jerico keeps carrier pigeons in a cage behind his house, and there is bird feed in his cupboard.</str>
line	<str>Omart will help me over the wall, but he needs a distraction for the Mourners in the watchtower.</str>
line	<str>I threw bird feed by the watchtower fence and released the pigeons, which distracted the Mourners.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Omart</col> gave me a rope ladder and I climbed over the wall into <col=800000>West Ardougne</col>. I need to get into the Mourner headquarters.</col>
step	6	6	After poisoning the stew
line	<str>Elena needs her Distillator back; the Mourners took it when they arrested her.</str>
line	<str>Jerico keeps carrier pigeons in a cage behind his house, and there is bird feed in his cupboard.</str>
line	<str>Omart will help me over the wall, but he needs a distraction for the Mourners in the watchtower.</str>
line	<str>I threw bird feed by the watchtower fence and released the pigeons, which distracted the Mourners.</str>
line	<str>Omart gave me a rope ladder and I climbed over the wall into West Ardougne.</str>
line	<col=000080>I put a <col=800000>Rotten apple</col> in the Mourners' stew and they fell ill. I need a way in. A doctor's gown might fool them.</col>
step	7	7	After finding the gown
line	<str>Elena needs her Distillator back; the Mourners took it when they arrested her.</str>
line	<str>Jerico keeps carrier pigeons in a cage behind his house, and there is bird feed in his cupboard.</str>
line	<str>Omart will help me over the wall, but he needs a distraction for the Mourners in the watchtower.</str>
line	<str>I threw bird feed by the watchtower fence and released the pigeons, which distracted the Mourners.</str>
line	<str>Omart gave me a rope ladder and I climbed over the wall into West Ardougne.</str>
line	<str>I put a Rotten apple in the Mourners' stew and they fell ill.</str>
line	<col=000080>I took a <col=800000>Medical gown</col> from <col=800000>Nurse Sarah</col>'s cupboard. With it on, the Mourners let me into their headquarters. I should look for the <col=800000>Distillator</col> upstairs.</col>
step	8	8	After finding the distillator
line	<str>Elena needs her Distillator back; the Mourners took it when they arrested her.</str>
line	<str>Jerico keeps carrier pigeons in a cage behind his house, and there is bird feed in his cupboard.</str>
line	<str>Omart will help me over the wall, but he needs a distraction for the Mourners in the watchtower.</str>
line	<str>I threw bird feed by the watchtower fence and released the pigeons, which distracted the Mourners.</str>
line	<str>Omart gave me a rope ladder and I climbed over the wall into West Ardougne.</str>
line	<str>I put a Rotten apple in the Mourners' stew and they fell ill.</str>
line	<str>I took a Medical gown from Nurse Sarah's cupboard. With it on, the Mourners let me into their headquarters.</str>
line	<col=000080>I killed the sickest Mourner upstairs and took his gate key. The <col=800000>Distillator</col> was in the crate behind the gate. I should take it back to <col=800000>Elena</col>.</col>
step	9	9	After returning the distillator
line	<str>Elena needs her Distillator back; the Mourners took it when they arrested her.</str>
line	<str>Jerico keeps carrier pigeons in a cage behind his house, and there is bird feed in his cupboard.</str>
line	<str>Omart will help me over the wall, but he needs a distraction for the Mourners in the watchtower.</str>
line	<str>I threw bird feed by the watchtower fence and released the pigeons, which distracted the Mourners.</str>
line	<str>Omart gave me a rope ladder and I climbed over the wall into West Ardougne.</str>
