line	<str>I took a Medical gown from Nurse Sarah's cupboard. With it on, the Mourners let me into their headquarters.</str>
line	<str>I killed the sickest Mourner upstairs and took his gate key. The Distillator was in the crate behind the gate.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Elena</col> tested the <col=800000>Distillator</col> and gave me a plague sample, along with <col=800000>Ethenea</col>, <col=800000>Liquid honey</col> and <col=800000>Sulphuric broline</col>. They must go to <col=800000>Guidor</col> in <col=800000>Varrock</col>. The <col=800000>Chemist</col> in <col=800000>Rimmington</col> can help me, and I must get the vials past the guard at the <col=800000>Varrock</col> gate.</col>
step	10	11	After collecting the vials
line	<str>Elena needs her Distillator back; the Mourners took it when they arrested her.</str>
line	<str>Jerico keeps carrier pigeons in a cage behind his house, and there is bird feed in his cupboard.</str>
