line	<str>I killed the sickest Mourner upstairs and took his gate key. The Distillator was in the crate behind the gate.</str>
line	<str>Elena tested the Distillator and gave me a plague sample, along with Ethenea, Liquid honey and Sulphuric broline. They must go to Guidor in Varrock.</str>
line	<col=000080>The <col=800000>Chemist</col>'s errand boys smuggled the vials past the guard and gave them back to me at the <col=800000>Dancing Donkey</col> inn in <col=800000>Varrock</col>. I should take the sample and vials to <col=800000>Guidor</col>, wearing a priest gown.</col>
step	11	12	After seeing Guidor
line	<str>Elena needs her Distillator back; the Mourners took it when they arrested her.</str>
line	<str>Jerico keeps carrier pigeons in a cage behind his house, and there is bird feed in his cupboard.</str>
