line	<str>The Chemist's errand boys smuggled the vials past the guard and gave them back to me at the Dancing Donkey inn in Varrock.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Guidor</col> tested the sample and found nothing: there is no plague. I should tell <col=800000>Elena</col>.</col>
